# Recording from a SEQ page: with REC armed on a synth track the keys play and record notes;
# holding SEQ turns them back into steps. Not armed, they are steps as before.
wait 300
tap SEQ
wait 150
expect steps 1 0
tapkey 12
wait 100
expect steps 1 1
tapkey 12
wait 100
expect steps 1 0
tap PLAY
tap REC
wait 200
key 12 down
wait 120
key 12 up
wait 300
key 16 down
wait 120
key 16 up
wait 300
shot rec_seq.png
expect steps 1 2
press SEQ
tapkey 2
release SEQ
wait 100
expect steps 1 3
tap REC
tap PLAY
wait 200
expect page STEPS
